{"product_id":"the-great-smelling-bee-rotten-school-2","title":"The Great Smelling Bee (Rotten School #2)","description":"\u003cp\u003eSherman Oaks Is A Rat. Sherman is so spoiled and rich that he threw away his allowance because some of the hundred-dollar bills were wrinkled!He and his goody-goody friends and Nyce House are always trying to get Bernie Bridges and his Rotten House buddies into trouble.Well Bernie's in big trouble now. Bernie has a dog in his room, Sherman know it -- and there are NO PETS ALLOWED at Rotten School!Bernie has to find a way to hide Gassy, his dog. But the dog stinks. Hey, why do you think they call him Gassy?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 137 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: R.L. Stine\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780060785895\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45174666264729,"sku":"5RB9780060785895","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67bc16518697e_The_20Great_20Smelling_20Bee_20_Rotten_20School_20_232_20R.L._20Stine.jpg?v=1752084588","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-great-smelling-bee-rotten-school-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}